<title>USA: Case Corp Q1 net, revenues rise.</title>
<headline>Case Corp Q1 net, revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.83		   $ 0.70</p>
<p> Shr diluted	     $ 0.82		   $ 0.69</p>
<p> Net			 62,000		   51,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,232,000		1,171,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 net includes $22 million extraordinary after-tax charge from early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 revenues include sales of $1.18 billion vs $1.11 billion in 1996 Q1.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
